{"id":"vod_bf_76105","vodId":"76105","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"精灵幻想记第二季","name_cn":"精灵幻想记第二季","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20241008-1/22ca1212a0e64e67c0280643924efcce.jpg"},"summary":"“前世と現世が交錯する――異世界転生ファンタジー新章開幕!! 　　幼い頃に母を殺され、スラム街の孤児となった少年リオ。七歳のある日、彼の中で不慮の事故で死んだ日本の大学生《天川春人の記憶》が甦り、同時に《膨大な魔力》が覚醒した。 　　それから様々な出会いと別れを経験したリオは、両親の故郷で母を殺した宿敵への復讐を胸に誓う。 　　数年の旅を経てシュトラール地方へと舞い戻ったリオは、望まぬ政略結婚を強いられていた恩師セリアを救出。だが、その直後、突如として出現した光の柱に導かれるようにして、彼は己が前世である天川春人の初恋の少女綾瀬美春と衝撃的な再会を果たす――","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-12-24 00:52:01","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/jinglinghuanxiangjidierji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:5